models, or licenses or distribution models similar to any of the following: Apache License, MIT License, BSD 3-Clause &ldquo;New&rdquo;
or &ldquo;Revised&rdquo; License or BSD 2-Clause &ldquo;Simplified&rdquo; or &ldquo;FreeBSD&rdquo; License, GNU&rsquo;s General Public
